 "N195": {"text": "Design: Mid's Market, coin, bank and ventures; goods and workshops; trade and caravans (11-orders.js LOT, worth, coinOf, sellPrice, buyPrice, haveOf, marketTrade; 36-economy.js mkt, debase, mktHit, spiceCost, priceDrift, venture, ventureTick, BANK_CAP, bankTick, setMake, stopsAll, postAt, stopsHeld, distF, baseOf, loadable, takeFrom, giveTo, priceAt, tradeTargets, allyMarket, targetOf, homeBiz, estPay, setRoute, bestTarget, routeTick, guardedCart, robbed, the route holders' pay and the spring's fleece; 13-sim-civil.js atShop, shopTick, makeNow, caravanTick; 08-core.js makeOf, gatherMul's scale; 14-sim-troops.js escortPick; 28-army-quick.js guardsOf; 03-rules-buildings.js GOODS, LOAD, CARAVAN, VENTURE, PRICE, MINT, BLD market, workshop, mint, foundry, tpost and every building's cost and t; 06-rules-tuning.js TRADE, SELL, BUY, SCALE, PLACES.stop, ROUTES, POST, MKT_SELL, MKT_BUY, MKTK; 02-rules-units.js the caravan; 04-rules-tech.js the Trade, Coin, Scale, Cloth, Drink, Furnace, Caravans and Roads lines and Free trade), read in staging/ and mid/src this session; with its values by the 10:31 rule; no surplus selling for anyone (Albert, Nov 5 11:16 (5)); the vassals' share of trade waits with the vassals (tribute only, 11:16 (2)); brought by Albert's yes, Nov 5 11:40 (Frankenstein F26+F27)", "opened": true, "kind": "design"},
